{"version": 1, "paragraphs": {"p0": {"original": "语言是窗户（否则，它们是墙）", "sourceHash": "1295d460500a5b3fd96ed3361a734de8fa0ea30c45dbd80b0066c558033ddcf9", "en": "Languages are windows (or they are walls)"}, "p1": {"original": "听了你的话，我仿佛受了审判，", "sourceHash": "9ae27685ecfc30cb8839103b45704ecb5f3999b2dc31e67b6f3db60642384a83", "en": "Listening to you, I feel like I've been tried."}, "p2": {"original": "无比委屈，又无从分辩，", "sourceHash": "a328c36885bcf0a2b3c2791f81575012b11f4add5ffb9c1ff72147156fdd4235", "en": "\"I am not sure how to fight, I am not sure how to fight.\""}, "p3": {"original": "在离开前，我想问，", "sourceHash": "15e6f6e1797d65104bcb3e3897fd87503077ea58b91be5fa740e38759f41ecad", "en": "Before I leave, I want to ask,"}, "p4": {"original": "那真的是你的意思吗？", "sourceHash": "23853fa1b534b84bd1717b458a1ed4880e1f3fb02ccc0764b96c2bc6406ffa0d", "en": "Is that really what you mean?"}, "p5": {"original": "", "sourceHash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "en": ""}, "p6": {"original": "在自我辩护前，", "sourceHash": "11df5fa4e4d6cef6d75d89ab843144a8cca7ecb5573df52e96abfde99aaa4123", "en": "I am not sure if I am going to do this."}, "p7": {"original": "在带着痛苦或恐惧质问前，", "sourceHash": "27cb519c658499ec3e1f1f7756b9d6197f6bdaf2b2fcc2cce554a696d969f90e", "en": "Before asking questions about pain or fear,"}, "p8": {"original": "在我用言语筑起心灵之墙前，", "sourceHash": "9f3ca90f952ebfb786ed7303ec7949c16a6ccbb736b0e9e05d9e99e51221c3ee", "en": "I have no idea what I'm talking about."}, "p9": {"original": "告诉我，我听明白了吗？", "sourceHash": "4862f85307eb7331c6a49a6ac8a84c15dc3b89ff0518b0fdad6c8e4ac3bb9828", "en": "Tell me, do I understand?"}, "p10": {"original": "", "sourceHash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "en": ""}, "p11": {"original": "语言是窗户，或者是墙，", "sourceHash": "f917d01845087cc43a8a1b67976bac5cb05d7bb07c4b8a314de49ddb6830152f", "en": "The language is a window, or a wall,"}, "p12": {"original": "它们审判我们，或者让我们自由。", "sourceHash": "0fdd8fca95fda42a7ea7bb0c1c75bf06070e8d955ae78a40e76ae77fcac295ef", "en": "They judge us, or they set us free."}, "p13": {"original": "在我说与听的时候，", "sourceHash": "2cf1c718df2621501fe4513f1db49a56c3951d91a2e5bd7873728acf5327d0e4", "en": "And when I say and listen,"}, "p14": {"original": "请让爱的光芒照耀我。", "sourceHash": "2d494e6fb051438a5a9398392337fd1975bc763b8e449e2d000a9b591e30b53c", "en": "Let the light of love shine upon me."}, "p15": {"original": "", "sourceHash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "en": ""}, "p16": {"original": "我心里有话要说，", "sourceHash": "b5f35be7144bc45ce6f86efebeb5ef43b424452fbb0ce6cdd543d256ea08982a", "en": "I have something to say in my heart."}, "p17": {"original": "那些话对我如此重要，", "sourceHash": "0a4fbf2c1cb59ae89051e9a931dbc19086e0e944056053223ae0fc8e40734a7a", "en": "I'm not sure what I'm talking about."}, "p18": {"original": "如果言语无法传达我的心声，", "sourceHash": "377cf23ab3e6e9e6ca77bfb96e1c6f792554cba1dfc7d086fbed934e3a1223af", "en": "If words don't convey my heart,"}, "p19": {"original": "请你帮我获得自由好吗？", "sourceHash": "9d192409003e8048ced92f497ab822992ca71bfbf3beee0a3b1dc461a748079b", "en": "Will you help me to be free?"}, "p20": {"original": "", "sourceHash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "en": ""}, "p21": {"original": "如果你以为我想羞辱你，", "sourceHash": "d906f279e04d02cecda89bca7e1a28d2c9210736f11567fdf06324897417a01a", "en": "If you think I want to humiliate you,"}, "p22": {"original": "如果你认定我不在乎你，", "sourceHash": "4ec5af77159ae9d61102b051fb695e6a2e0e1de49251b9f4db7e74be5c101565", "en": "If you think I don't care about you,"}, "p23": {"original": "请透过我的言语，", "sourceHash": "4793289d3bf0c06dfe730bacbeb28872ab41d4d1e34dd900d093b25c09fb41c2", "en": "Please pass through my words."}, "p24": {"original": "倾听我们共有的情感。", "sourceHash": "f3ebda97008c0857f6f952340fdda2e8ffa1f5010db264761ecdb190eb4b4951", "en": "Listen to our shared feelings."}, "p25": {"original": "——鲁思·贝本梅尔（Ruth Bebermeyer）", "sourceHash": "0d52250137ade84a25f0dac39e74e9269045d95f9e68578a11ba42ade47ea525", "en": "— Ruth Bebermeyer"}}}